    {
      "text": "Fragment of a colour-coded table with columns 'Drug Class' and 'Result Call': for drug class N/A, the rows read INVALID/ERROR/NO RESULT (white), MTB DETECTED (red) and MTB NOT DETECTED (green). It illustrates how non-determinate Xpert MTB/XDR results relate to MTB DETECTED and MTB NOT DETECTED.",
